@startuml
!include skin.iuml
participant "App (SQLite WAL)" as A
participant Litestream as L
participant "rclone\n(cron 03:15 WIB)" as R
participant "Cloudflare R2\nbucket vie-portfolio-backup" as B
participant "You (restore)" as Y
== Continuous ==
A -> L : every write lands in the WAL
L -> B : ship WAL segments (seconds)
L -> B : snapshot, keep 168 h (7 days)
== Nightly ==
R -> B : copy new files in /data/uploads\n(never deletes remotely)
== Restore on a fresh VPS ==
Y -> B : litestream restore -> /data/app.db
Y -> B : rclone copy back -> /data/uploads
Y -> A : docker compose up -d
note right of Y
Restore was rehearsed on a throw-away volume:
row counts and a public page matched.
end note
@enduml
